        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fort_Totten%2C_North_Dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "After 1890, the fort transitioned into a boarding school for Native American children.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
